    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leap, Conquer, and Push Your Limits in This High-Stakes Infinite Platformer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse treacherous landscapes, evade relentless enemies, and test your reflexes in this fast-paced infinite jumper. Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned platforming expert, this game offers endless action and challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Characters &amp; Unlock Powerful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 distinct characters</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Uncover a <strong>secret character</strong> waiting to be discovered and push your high score even further. Adapt your strategy and find the perfect hero to dominate the leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer Ever-Changing Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 dynamically designed worlds</strong>, each packed with unique obstacles, enemies, and hazards. Every run presents a new challenge, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Upgrade, and Rise to the Top</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins as you progress, smash through enemies, and unlock exclusive rewards. Elevate your experience with new characters and abilities to refine your strategy and reach new heights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>10 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with distinct abilities, including a secret unlockable character. <br>\u2705 <strong>5 Unique Infinite Levels</strong> \u2013 Diverse environments, unpredictable hazards, and escalating difficulty.<br>\u2705 <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Test your reflexes with increasingly difficult platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Coin Starter Bonus\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Downloading the game provides a free 450 coins to unlock an extra new character or level of your choice right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you climb? Prove your skills, set new records, and conquer the ultimate infinite platforming challenge!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leap, Conquer, and Push Your Limits in This High-Stakes Infinite Platformer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse treacherous landscapes, evade relentless enemies, and test your reflexes in this fast-paced infinite jumper. Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned platforming expert, this game offers endless action and challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Characters &amp; Unlock Powerful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>10 distinct characters</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Uncover a <strong>secret character</strong> waiting to be discovered and push your high score even further. Adapt your strategy and find the perfect hero to dominate the leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer Ever-Changing Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 dynamically designed worlds</strong>, each packed with unique obstacles, enemies, and hazards. Every run presents a new challenge, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Upgrade, and Rise to the Top</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather coins as you progress, smash through enemies, and unlock exclusive rewards. Elevate your experience with new characters and abilities to refine your strategy and reach new heights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>10 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with distinct abilities, including a secret unlockable character. <br>\u2705 <strong>5 Unique Infinite Levels</strong> \u2013 Diverse environments, unpredictable hazards, and escalating difficulty.<br>\u2705 <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Test your reflexes with increasingly difficult platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Coin Starter Bonus\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Downloading the game provides a free 450 coins to unlock an extra new character or level of your choice right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you climb? Prove your skills, set new records, and conquer the ultimate infinite platforming challenge!</p>",
